aff\n\n-Shows toast notifications when a mod/staff joins\n\n-Customizable toast duration, animation, and sound\n\n-Message shows player name and reason for detection\n\n-Highlights detected players with color-coded outline\n\n-Adds BillboardGui above player head showing name and reason\n\n-Draggable modern GUI panel saved between respawns\n\n-Buttons: Refresh scan, Toggle scanning, Open history window\n\n-Status bar shows current scan status and latest detection\n\n-History window lists detected players with username, UserId, reason, and timestamp\n\n-Search bar in history filters by name or reason\n\n-Export CSV copies detection history to clipboard\n\n-Watches new players, attribute changes, and character changes automatically\n\n-Double-click GUI title opens history window\n\n-Debounces notifications to avoid repeats\n\n-Runs continuous periodic scan loop\n\n-Optional sound notification on detection","tags":["detector","Universal script","OP","Admin","Mod"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"65477fc91c830f9073e59573","username":"MrEblanlol","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"65477fc91c830f9073e59573","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:05:39.919Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69ba9c7207a74a82f8671353","editBy":{"_id":"65477fc91c830f9073e59573","username":"MrEblanlol","status":"offline","id":"65477fc91c830f9073e59573"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-18T12:37:06.860Z"},{"_id":"69ba9cd507a74a82f8671949","editBy":{"_id":"65477fc91c830f9073e59573","username":"MrEblanlol","status":"offline","id":"65477fc91c830f90